+## Scenario: Compaction-path marker for the notebook save gate (18.10.1)
+
+### 1. Scope / Trigger
+
+`patches/context-notes-save-gate.ts` vetoes `session_before_compact` while the experimental notebook is stale. The hook event carries no mode, so summary-path compactions (plain `/compact`) were vetoed too. Trigger: any change that adds a compaction path, a `/compact` subcommand, or a `session_before_compact` emit site. Owner: `family-compaction-v18.10.1.patch` (runtime) and the extension (consumer).
+
+### 2. Signatures
+
+```ts
+interface SessionBeforeCompactEvent { notesBacked?: boolean } // false = summary path; true/absent = notes-backed
+type CompactMode = "soft" | "remote" | "snapcompact" | "context"
+```
+
+### 3. Contracts
+
+- Every emit site states its path: notes-backed rollover (`#compactExperimentalContext`, `#runExperimentalContextRollover`) emits `true`; summary paths (manual `compact()` summary pipeline, `runAutoCompaction`) emit `false`.
+- The gate waves through only `notesBacked === false`. Absent or `true` keeps the strict veto, so version skew in either direction stays fail-closed.
+- Only `/compact context` runs the hidden notes checkpoint and the notes-backed rollover; it is rejected before `disconnectFromAgent()`/`abort()` when the notebook is not live, and rejects focus text.
+
+### 4. Validation & Error Matrix
+
+| Condition | Required result |
+|---|---|
+| stale notebook, `notesBacked:false` | no veto, no repair message, no notice |
+| stale notebook, `true` or absent | veto, bounded repair as before |
+| `mode:"context"`, notebook not live | throw before abort; running turn survives |
+| new emit site without a marker | treated as notes-backed (veto); fix the site |
+
+### 5. Good / Base / Bad Cases
+
+- Good: plain `/compact` summarizes with a stale notebook; `/compact context` saves first.
+- Base: automatic rollover still vetoed while stale.
+- Bad: inferring the path from `customInstructions`, idle state or message shape inside the hook.
+
+### 6. Tests Required
+
+`bun patches/verify-context-notes-save-gate.ts` (marker scenarios plus mutations: marker ignored; absent treated as false) and `OMP_NM=<candidate> bun patches/verify-manual-notes-compaction.ts`. A gate harness MUST prove the real extension is live (marker-stripped control must veto): sessions built with `restrictToolNames` ignore `additionalExtensionPaths`, which once left the real gate unexercised. Re-grep `session_before_compact` over src and dist for every emit site.
+
+### 7. Wrong vs Correct
+
+```text
+Wrong: gate passes every manual compaction, or treats a missing marker as a summary path.
+Correct: pass only an explicit `false`; mark every emit site; keep absent = veto.
+```
